    {
      "id": "92954e7c1e1348859e7ed84ea99c6b658c40c80bcb926d053e08db2d007f1900",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "47220a9dec4d4c60f52fafefafa54a18ada778abb4386be0c0a5447173fd6ed5",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "39148dffc02cda7d521ff3dbc650581a92bae02ae2342fa4ac990d6fe9aa5769",
      "text": "Let's look at literally the simplest setup that the AI SDK supports: generating text.",
      "hash": "7e3402dec77eb4fa124ede671462d74c27ab03bfd220879417009a4e23871f6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d1649f8895e56c98e85233713ef49535d9f453d5079e4356a8b6fd512c8db77",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "d48f01139cce1e59481d7046890b537261161a26b6ce3347f566b5c9a2cfff6c",
      "text": "You take the",
      "hash": "35546803d527bc13b491554d30f8a323fd43624b0707b4ce5683020bce44d7c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "06e7e3bb0b4118acaefa77e4170777f16b76dd0543ef38f110067b8083fd3578",
      "text": "function that you import from",
      "hash": "b7bb75a554b6474c58d39b3060b1d56cdfdefff5877fadd761781f7bb2e10919"
    },
    {
      "id": "3bef70e6499e6d8e1102d482940a3284f5671428f7034a69174f2a0902b583e5",
      "text": ", pass it a prompt and a model, and you get back an object that contains some text.",
      "hash": "e9aa5dc64b3b90d952e0cec910bc09baf900b7c75b8bd33badf711e1ca96a768"
    },
    {
      "id": "315792640b697286bcf98f2b1bda1e3262bf83e61cd34ec1b913739a8259efa3",
      "text": "The model we're using is Anthropic's",
      "hash": "a4eba1e81753b3017fc2cc92db6844d749d906f7559aa3aad565f2f3b538dd50"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab018bd8be526a46f42f39a833126e4e82c97587f52c1b00821b19ec975af546",
      "text": ", which we're getting from Vercel's",
      "hash": "84e932964f7bed38ac37a65c2489b72de8473a3bfc4a7792102c3eac6782ebf0"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7be4a73d344a0a6bfc756133cd6a0382ed91b7646c50a08d62be2202324ff03",
      "text": "If we wanted to, we could specify a different model - let's say we're using",
      "hash": "8410c1b6ee849547d18aeff19c6c41692472555414eeee1586eba6d7bc2e93d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae5b31948778b4c5c43be18c24048b3f3f761f48b287745f11e5f66bf828c142",
      "text": "instead.",
      "hash": "90b5d13011f6a86532541bbf1ec3c2c9f09d654e267e4e889db77b09b8bbb990"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd112c9ff970385550ace47c409e7536d391c47f97d41035131e7abb1976604e",
      "text": "We can then use the function that we've created called",
      "hash": "7e4d13a30f38d9ba6f3155b010be7bb41fd1b512970d54c2a1dcecabf2c86040"
    },
    {
      "id": "841bbe33f69ca9cdb03cfc5f4519a352f74af5b8b18bcfd38874ed0774bc33f3",
      "text": "Let's say we ask it \"what is the chemical formula for dihydrogen monoxide?\"",
      "hash": "ba8922115cbf86d630331199738da75ed158822188407213597120f880bc0288"
    },
    {
      "id": "5304efc3f5f173eb19582b77cb7e3b852acdeaee8f80fe5dc3b0033a41c07a59",
      "text": "When we run this, it will call Anthropic with our query and get back the answer to the question we asked it.",
      "hash": "01f95dd37fdd7706f5d955babbc6e472dcb1d49f3042d2ee8c29e2b6f602ce0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c3fd0d8727a18bf1c67fc9abf2aa311b0cd6c1d59f26138562f3b96cbf506aa",
      "text": "There's also a bunch of other stuff in this object that we get back, but we'll cover that in our other examples.",
      "hash": "2de77b46def317695ad9e5b3c58c8892d1dae31e202e6bcbfd7851f32a75f20e"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b5771ae15575854b6c6de2cb0bf66c2e78b571b14fde8e69e1dae01c0a14a95",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
